<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66590" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετα-βλητικός</span></b>  (
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετα-βλᾱτικός</span></b>  [<i><span class="en">
			Philol.
		</span></i>] <i><span class="en">
			21
		</span></i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
			Hippod.
		</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
			Stob.
			4.1.94
		</span></i>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>for</i> or
				<i>in the way of exchange</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ [χρῆσις] ἡ μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1257a9
				</span></i>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ -κή</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>) <i>exchange, barter</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				223d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1258b21
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ -κόν</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γένος</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				224d
			</span></i>. Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					4.51
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>able to produce change</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1020a5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1013a32
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύναμις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.278
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίνησις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					9.195
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>subject to change</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				6.10.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τἀναντία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>GC</u>
					319a20
				</span></i>
			; of animals, <i>mobile</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόνιμα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HA</u>
				487b6
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>GA</u>
				715a26
			</span></i>.</div>
